{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:99fc2d33f6e78bd7","name":"Medical Secrets","source":{"id":"source:reference-99fc2d33f6e78bd7","title":"Medical Secrets","revision":19521,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:07:19Z","sha256":"418e0e8af61be4684063e4c8bdb9d0e60747596a4fbb6ecd180bab63b7e5ad0f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19521","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Medical%20Secrets&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-99fc2d33f6e78bd7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a Medic's medical skills grow, they gain insight into specific medical procedures and treatment of specific ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},". At each even-numbered level (2nd, 4th, 6th and so on), the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medic","referenceId":"reference:25877b98fccba1d5"}," gains a Medical Secret, giving them a bonus when using a specific application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," skill. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medic","referenceId":"reference:25877b98fccba1d5"}," can select a given Medical Secret only once.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Medical Secrets"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved First Aid"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medpac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medpac","referenceId":"reference:f89e0de3ab0ae989"}," to perform ",{"tag":"a","children":["First Aid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/First_Aid"}," with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," skill, the creature gains one additional point for every point by which your check exceeds the DC (in addition to any extra ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Point"}," gained normally for exceeding the DC).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Heal Damage"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["On a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surgery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surgery"}," attempt to Heal Damage, the target recovers an additional number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," equal to your Class Level.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Long-Term Care"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["On a successful application of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Long-Term Care"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Long-Term_Care"},", the target recovers an additional number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," equal to your Class Level.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Perform Surgery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can attempt a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check to perform ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surgery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surgery"}," in half the usual time.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Revivify"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revivify"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revivify"}," someone as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Treatment"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Disease"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Disease"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Radiation"}," in 1 hour, instead of 8 hours. Also, you can treat up to twice as many patients as normal.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Personal Physician"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You take no penalties on your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," when using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," skill on yourself.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
